{"4550140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flame Hunter: Zhong Kui", "steam_appid": 4550140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo out now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Flame Hunter: Zhong Kui demo is out now!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter a stunning supernatural world inspired by ancient Chinese myth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become <strong>Zhong Kui</strong>, an unlikely warrior on a quest for redemption. In this fast-paced action RPG, you'll fight, capture, and transform your way through a magical universe that blends heart with fluid hack-and-slash combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/e5e8cd13698ee8950702643345252302.poster.avif?t=1787817708\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/e5e8cd13698ee8950702643345252302.webm?t=1787817708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/e5e8cd13698ee8950702643345252302.mp4?t=1787817708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack and Slash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fast, ferocious, and empowering. Battle dozens of unique demons across four distinct realms The human world, the dragon realm, the spirit realm, and the Underworld. Don't just defeat your enemies. <strong>Capture them.</strong> Monsters you catch can be morphed into, granting you their unique abilities, attack patterns, and playstyle. Turn the forces of darkness against themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/1496c0d9e64cfe32b2b93bbc400cb85a.poster.avif?t=1787817708\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/1496c0d9e64cfe32b2b93bbc400cb85a.webm?t=1787817708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/1496c0d9e64cfe32b2b93bbc400cb85a.mp4?t=1787817708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shapeshifting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a growing arsenal of demon forms. Morph into a fire breathing demon and set obstacles ablaze. Transform into an unstoppable peach and ram through barriers. Shift into a industrious mole rat and dig your way through problems. Each new capture expands your tactical options and rewards experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/d6da9dee48bd086acf5b7585f8a99e38.poster.avif?t=1787817708\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/d6da9dee48bd086acf5b7585f8a99e38.webm?t=1787817708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/d6da9dee48bd086acf5b7585f8a99e38.mp4?t=1787817708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your character to unlock powerful new skills and customize your combat style. Discover hidden items scattered across the realms that empower Zhong Kui against even the fiercest foes. Then use your newfound abilities to solve puzzles. Opening secret paths, activating ancient mechanisms, and uncovering lost treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/c3192e920cdedea9e81fab4d0f72b33a.poster.avif?t=1787817708\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/c3192e920cdedea9e81fab4d0f72b33a.webm?t=1787817708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/c3192e920cdedea9e81fab4d0f72b33a.mp4?t=1787817708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectacle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond combat, experience <strong>heart-pounding set pieces</strong>. Epic boss battles that test your reflexes, cinematic chase sequences that demand quick thinking, and explosive moments that push your demon morphing skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple <strong>game modes</strong> offer variety and replayability, giving you fresh challenges beyond the main campaign.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter a stunning supernatural world inspired by ancient Chinese myth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become <strong>Zhong Kui</strong>, an unlikely warrior on a quest for redemption. In this fast-paced action RPG, you'll fight, capture, and transform your way through a magical universe that blends heart with fluid hack-and-slash combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550140/extras/e5e8cd13698ee8950702643345252302.poster.avif?t=1787817708\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co